[47.681, "o", "Peer a: hacp.skill.answer\r\n  text: \"The signature is greet(name: str) -> str, importable as from greet import greet. It uses name.strip(), preserves internal whitespace and case, returns f\\\"Hello, {name}!\\\" using the stripped name, and raises ValueError when the stripped name is empty. Exception message is unspecified; non-string inputs are outside the interface. Acceptance is python3 -m unittest -v.\"\r\n"]
